      "message": "This would silence the error but it also seems like it could introduce surprising crashes into applications. Is there anything we would need to do to import a mapped buffer other than `WebGPU.Internals.bufferOnUnmaps[bufferPtr] \u003d []`?\n\nThat said, it does make me realize that any map/unmap operation happening in JS even _after_ import is going to mess up emscripten\u0027s state...",
