      "writtenOn": "2025-02-28T02:55:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yea, the state is the issue here. If we are already mapped, we might not be able to `GetMappedRange` on certain stuff. And if we do stuff with the buffer in JS, we can\u0027t reflect the state in WASM. I\u0027m not sure how to make it work for this atm...",
